<title>USA: IBM may issue debt - syndicate sources.</title>
<headline>IBM may issue debt - syndicate sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp is rumored to be soliciting bids for a $400 million competitive debt offering, syndicate sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The A1/A rated deal is expected to consist of a one-year note, sources said.</p>
<p>Earlier this morning sources said IBM was taking bids on the proposed debt offering, they added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
